---
// Contact.astro — 档案 08 · 联系交流（极简居中 · 达成转化）
const wechat = 'G10S7H21';
const email = '1462882928@qq.com';
---

<section id="contact" class="section contact">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-head centered"><span class="no">档案 08</span> 联系交流</p>
    <h2 class="contact-title">聊得来，就一起做事。</h2>
    <div class="contact-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-solid" data-copy={wechat}>
        加微信聊聊 · {wechat}
      </button>
      <span class="contact-or">或</span>
      <a class="btn btn-line" href={`mailto:${email}`}>写邮件</a>
    </div>
    <p class="contact-source">雇主与过程细节对公开版隐去 · 详询索取 ↘</p>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  // 复制微信号：clipboard API 失败用 prompt 兜底（老浏览器）
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-copy]').forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const val = btn.dataset.copy;
      if (!val) return;
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(val);
        const original = btn.textContent;
        btn.textContent = '已复制 ✓';
        setTimeout(() => (btn.textContent = original), 1500);
      } catch {
        try {
          window.prompt('请复制微信号', val);
        } catch {
          /* 老环境：提示用户手记 */
        }
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .contact {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .section-head.centered {
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .section-head.centered::before {
    content: none;
  }
  .contact-title {
    font-size: var(--text-4xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .contact-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }
  .contact-or {
    color: var(--color-line);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
  .contact-source {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-line);
  }
</style>